{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-skip-skip-skip","version":1,"title":"Skip, Skip, Skip (a skipping rhyme)","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Turn the rope; turn it round.\nJump when it touches the ground!","sentences":["Turn the rope; turn it round.","Jump when it touches the ground!"],"alt":"Two children turn a rope while a third waits to jump.","image":{"hash":"sha256:9679916727a8c1bbda36b3d079baff6e06338b2c4f44bfc11c50a91ec1fd7607","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d10300d4a182c694820a0f924c39cf801469ecd9b64d618ad63025482323784a","durationMs":5920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2885],[2885,5920]],"words":[[0,398],[398,696],[696,1343],[1343,1741],[1741,1940],[1940,2885],[2885,3283],[3283,3681],[3681,3880],[3880,4577],[4577,4875],[4875,5920]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"One, two, three, four, five,\nwe keep on jumping, bright and alive!","sentences":["One, two, three, four, five,\nwe keep on jumping, bright and alive!"],"alt":"A child jumping as others count.","image":{"hash":"sha256:89004ee16c3c177883fbbdf8eb26d602d65bae7df7ce83d39fa9fe001cce8b61","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e02e35256f8bd069ddfac0881205e5d2268053e0a18dc8c10662bd332743ccc0","durationMs":9440,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,9440]],"words":[[0,769],[769,1538],[1538,2587],[2587,3496],[3496,4405],[4405,4685],[4685,5244],[5244,5524],[5524,6853],[6853,7692],[7692,8111],[8111,9440]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Oh no! The rope has caught my toe.\nThat is all right, I try, and off I go!","sentences":["Oh no!","The rope has caught my toe.","That is all right, I try, and off I go!"],"alt":"A child whose foot caught in the rope, smiling.","image":{"hash":"sha256:b623fd65488ab7a3a7728c00193c81e0bca2951745ccd29cce4fc31e31f3ffdc","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:eba18ef73e6cfbcf6167b9a0be72e26048e617380c972f4db